flowchart TD
    Start([User clicks 'Select Service']) --> CheckSession{User holds active token\nin WAITING or SERVING?}
    
    CheckSession -- Yes --> ShowHeldBanner[Display 'Active Ticket Held' Banner\nBlock new issuance\nPrompt to view tracker]
    ShowHeldBanner --> End([Halt])

    CheckSession -- No --> OpenModal[Open Request Token Modal Dialog\nRender expected sequence number & baseline wait]
    OpenModal --> InputData[User inputs optional name / student ID\n(Client-side capped at 80 chars)]
    InputData --> Submit[User clicks 'Confirm & Get Token']

    Submit --> ValidateCatalog{Service in approved\ncatalog?}
    ValidateCatalog -- No --> ReturnCatalogError[Return INVALID_SERVICE error]
    ReturnCatalogError --> End

    ValidateCatalog -- Yes --> CheckPaused{Is target service\nPAUSED?}
    CheckPaused -- Yes --> ReturnPausedError[Return SERVICE_PAUSED error\n'Desk is currently paused']
    ReturnPausedError --> End

    CheckPaused -- No --> IncrementCounter[Fetch current service sequence counter\nnextSequence = counter + 1]
    IncrementCounter --> FormatToken[Format Token Number: PREFIX-NNN\ne.g., ADM-001\nSanitize name: trim and slice to 80 chars]
    FormatToken --> CreateTokenObj[Construct Token Object with status: WAITING\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nIncrement state.version]
    CreateTokenObj --> PersistState{Attempt save to\nlocalStorage\n'queueless_state_v1'}

    PersistState -- Fails --> Rollback[Return PERSISTENCE_FAILED\nReturn untouched state\nNo token issued]
    Rollback --> End

    PersistState -- Success --> StoreSession[Store token ID in\n'queueless_active_token_id_v1']
    StoreSession --> Broadcast[Broadcast TOKEN_ISSUED event\nvia BroadcastChannel]
    Broadcast --> NavTracker[Navigate customer view to #/tracker]
    NavTracker --> SuccessEnd([Token active in Tracker])

